    - Key: MAX_1
      Value:
      - "\"Oh! Sorry for surprising you.\xA4Didn\u2019t expect to see a new face
        here. Forgot you were replacing the other guy.\xA4A shame. I quite liked
        him. Though I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll fit right in as well!\xA4Anyway"
      - "nice to meet you! Don\u2019t worry"
    - Key: CONNIE_2_A
      Value:
      - '"Hey'
      - "pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do that
        again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five"
    - Key: CONNIE_2_B
      Value:
      - '"Hey'
      - "pal!\xA4Thanks for covering my ass yesterday.\xA4Knew you were a real mate.\xA4Really
        appreciate it. And you know I\u2019ll return the favor.\xA4So! Met any new
        friends?\xA4Not much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only
        the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five"
